#. column 2: Viltgance-type hulls
#. column 8: A hull which utilizes a rigid, lightweight frame for a more stable flight.
msgctxt "Item:14003:0:9"
msgid "Viltgance-type Hull"
msgstr "Корпус типа «Вильтганс»"

#. ja: ヴィルトガンス級霊翼
#. de: Paar[p] Ätherschwingen vom Typ „Viltgance“
#. fr: kit d'ailes éthérées de type Viltgance
#. column 2: sets of Viltgance-type aetherwings
#. column 8: The wings of a Viltgance-type airship, which adopt the same technology as Garlond Ironworks' manacutters in treating the wings with wind-aspected aether for buoyancy.
#. column 9: Viltgance-type Aetherwings
msgctxt "Item:14004:0:0"
msgid "set of Viltgance-type aetherwings"
msgstr "комплект эфирных крыльев типа «Вильтганс»"

#. de: Paar[p] Ätherschwingen vom Typ „Viltgance“
#. fr: kits d'ailes éthérées de type Viltgance
#. column 0: set of Viltgance-type aetherwings
#. column 8: The wings of a Viltgance-type airship, which adopt the same technology as Garlond Ironworks' manacutters in treating the wings with wind-aspected aether for buoyancy.
#. column 9: Viltgance-type Aetherwings
msgctxt "Item:14004:0:2"
msgid "sets of Viltgance-type aetherwings"
msgstr "комплекты эфирных крыльев типа «Вильтганс»"

#. ja: ヴィルトガンス級の霊翼。マナカッターの技術を応用したエーテル翼を採用
#. de: Die Schwingen eines Luftschiffs vom Typ „Viltgance“. Bei ihnen kommt die gleiche Äthertechnologie wie beim Manaschnitter zum Einsatz.
#. fr: Les ailes d'un aéronef de type Viltgance fon<shy>ction<shy>nant grâce à de l'éther corrompu, une technologie identique à celle utilisée sur le Manacutter des Forges de Garlond.
#. column 0: set of Viltgance-type aetherwings
#. column 2: sets of Viltgance-type aetherwings
#. column 9: Viltgance-type Aetherwings
msgctxt "Item:14004:0:8"
msgid "The wings of a Viltgance-type airship, which adopt the same technology as Garlond Ironworks' manacutters in treating the wings with wind-aspected aether for buoyancy."
msgstr "Крылья дирижабля типа «Вильтганс». Для подъёмной силы их обрабатывают ветровым эфиром по той же технологии, что и манакаттеры мастерской Гарлонда."

#. ja: ヴィルトガンス級霊翼
#. de: Ätherschwingen vom Typ „Viltgance“
#. fr: Ailes éthérées de type Viltgance
#. column 0: set of Viltgance-type aetherwings
#. column 2: sets of Viltgance-type aetherwings
#. column 8: The wings of a Viltgance-type airship, which adopt the same technology as Garlond Ironworks' manacutters in treating the wings with wind-aspected aether for buoyancy.
msgctxt "Item:14004:0:9"
msgid "Viltgance-type Aetherwings"
msgstr "Эфирные крылья типа «Вильтганс»"

