#. column 8: The front half of a Viltgance-type airship, including the main deck and a sharp, narrow bow to balance air resistance.
msgctxt "Item:14005:0:9"
msgid "Viltgance-type Forecastle"
msgstr "Носовая часть дирижабля типа «Вильтганс»"

