#. de: Beutel[p] Altrosensamen
#. fr: poignée de graines de rosier ancien
#. column 2: bags of oldrose seeds
#. column 8: Some say love, it is a river. Some say love, it is a flower. Plant these seeds and learn the truth.<br><br>※For use in planters.
#. column 9: Oldrose Seeds
